Package: soteria
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Soteria maintainers <noreply@akuadora.net>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36), systemd
Recommends: auditd
Suggests: apparmor
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/dd0c/Soteria
Description: host intrusion detection and integrity monitoring
 Soteria inventories a host, seals an approved baseline, and watches files,
 program executions, persistence locations, accounts, the kernel and boot
 configuration for deviations, with alerts, incidents and reports.
